      "text": "# load \u0026 inspect dataset\n\napi_url \u003d \u0027https://api.saas.enterprise.zetaris.com/\u0027\ndata_zetaris \u003d run_sql(\u0027select * from Fine_Food.Review limit 50\u0027, api_url)\nprint(data_zetaris)\nheaders \u003d data_zetaris[\u0027headers\u0027]\nrows \u003d data_zetaris[\u0027data\u0027]\nrecords \u003d [{headers[i]: row[i] for i in range(len(headers))} for row in rows]\nupdated_data \u003d {\u0027data\u0027: records}\ndf \u003d pd.DataFrame(updated_data[\u0027data\u0027])\ndf \u003d df[[\"Time\", \"ProductId\", \"UserId\", \"Score\", \"Summary\", \"Text\"]]\ndf \u003d df.dropna()\ndf[\"combined\"] \u003d (\n    \"Title: \" + df.Summary.str.strip() + \"; Content: \" + df.Text.str.strip()\n)\n",
      "user": "RAINATHOMAS@GMAIL.COM",
      "dateUpdated": "2025-01-21 06:40:11.328",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
