    {
      "text": "#Finding clusters using Kmeans\n\nn_clusters \u003d 4\ndf[\u0027Score\u0027] \u003d pd.to_numeric(df[\u0027Score\u0027], errors\u003d\u0027coerce\u0027) # Converting score to numeric\nkmeans \u003d KMeans(n_clusters\u003dn_clusters, init\u003d\"k-means++\", random_state\u003d42)\nkmeans.fit(matrix)\nlabels \u003d kmeans.labels_\ndf[\"Cluster\"] \u003d labels\ndf.groupby(\"Cluster\").Score.mean().sort_values()\n",
