      "text": "\n# Assuming df and n_clusters are already defined\nrev_per_cluster \u003d 5\nall_reviews \u003d []\n\nfor i in range(n_clusters):\n    reviews \u003d \"\\n\".join(\n        df[df.Cluster \u003d\u003d i]\n        .combined.str.replace(\"Title: \", \"\")\n        .str.replace(\"\\n\\nContent: \", \":  \")\n        .sample(rev_per_cluster, random_state\u003d42)\n        .values\n    )\n    all_reviews.append({\"Cluster\": i, \"Reviews\": reviews})\n\n# Create a DataFrame\nreviews_df \u003d pd.DataFrame(all_reviews)\n\nreviews_df.to_csv(\u0027/home/zetaris/customer-data/48e6c276/file-store/fine_food_review/reviews.csv\u0027,index\u003dFalse)",
